{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "rashomon-stories",
  "chunk_id": "rashomon-stories-chunk-0792",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00792",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "然后就是一场混乱的斗争。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Then a chaotic struggle broke out.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00792",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "“警察不讲道理！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The police will not listen to reason!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00792",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "“库拉巴喀，继续弹下去！弹下去！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Kurabaka, keep playing! Keep playing!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00792",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "“浑蛋！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You bastard!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00792",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "“畜生！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Damn you!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00792",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "“滚出去！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Get out!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00792",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "“绝对不让步！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "We will never give in!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00792",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "——人声鼎沸，椅子翻倒了，节目单扔的满天飞；",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Voices roared, chairs overturned, and programs were flung everywhere;",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00792",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "喝光的汽水瓶、石头块儿和啃了一半的黄瓜也不知道被谁扔了过来。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Empty soda bottles, chunks of stone, and even half-eaten cucumbers came flying from who knew where.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00792",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "我懵了，想问问托喀这是怎么了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I was stunned and wanted to ask Tok what was going on.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00792",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "托喀好像也激动起来了，他站在椅子上，一刻不停地叫嚷：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Tok seemed to have grown excited too; he stood on a chair and kept shouting without pause:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00792",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "“库拉巴喀，继续弹下去！弹下去！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Kurabaka, keep playing! Keep playing!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00792",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "托喀的那只美丽的雌河童似乎不知何时忘了对音乐家的仇怨，也喊起来：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Tok's beautiful female kappa seemed somehow to have forgotten her grudge against the musician and began shouting too:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00792",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "“警察不讲道理！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The police will not listen to reason!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00792",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "激动程度不比托喀低。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "She was no less excited than Tok.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00792",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "我不得不问马咯：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I could not help asking Mag:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00792",
      "unit_index": 17,
      "source_text": "“这究竟是怎么啦！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What on earth is going on here?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
